{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ada523a8c82cbd5f5f4e2b976c5f9ef9fcb4312b7321c455b7dada486ce01a10", "ja": "お疲れさま、桃子。\n衣装の確認中か？", "zh": "辛苦你了，桃子。\n你在确认服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "6e480fe596b26b23a64fed3332ca0c9ad911ad5544e5d51d42749155e42698b3", "ja": "あっ、お兄ちゃん。\nうん、まあね。いろいろ、チェックしておかないと。", "zh": "啊，大哥哥。\n嗯，对啊，要确认很多地方才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f1574a50f544ac121af092e6e8ecd1cc4f0d58266c250cef81d459e2674a17a7", "ja": "そうか。どこか気に入らないところがあったら、\n遠慮なく言ってくれ。直したいところとか。", "zh": "这样啊。要是有什么不喜欢的地方，\n尽管告诉我。比方说有没有地方想要修改的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "cc99a91ea01870bbfb6429bc286457316cf2c3b77a6f3d0f14ec47dd5f289225", "ja": "べ、別に、気に入らないところなんかないよ。\nブログにだって、ちゃんと書いたでしょ？", "zh": "是、是没有什么不喜欢的地方啦。\n部落格上不是都有写了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "03e9187e1d57ea53ec6bbe3150b29e2e6e130cd43fff197423c8fc8112d918c2", "ja": "この衣装、けっこうカワイイと思うよ。\nお兄ちゃんにしては、センスいいんじゃない？", "zh": "桃子觉得这套服装还挺可爱的。\n以大哥哥来说，眼光还算不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c4f4d9131a544281540f2cae114059eb718c274e98642569ab4509a53f43ce40", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\n桃子が気に入ってくれたならよかった。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。\n桃子你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "f8b9c46dc6d4114e4bf9fbda1e830521026e1b8c01f95d45088e31abefd1297b", "ja": "あ……あのね、お兄ちゃん。\n桃子……桃子ね……。", "zh": "那……那个，大哥哥，\n桃子……桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "99f81aca1042880fc247750ef3e0db9cfb5a45013ec33c1941488fbf707abb49", "ja": "お兄ちゃんに新しい衣装もらって、うれしいんだけど。\nなんか……ちょっと、怖い……。", "zh": "收到大哥哥准备的新服装是很高兴没错，\n但又觉得……有点害怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "ad7e5938fc53ce69600ef9e0fc952a00fbef3b7b68ff5490497106f35c56f252", "ja": "うれしいのに、怖いって……なんでなんだろ。\n桃子、どっかおかしいのかな……。", "zh": "同时觉得高兴和害怕……这是为什么呢？\n桃子是不是怪怪的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8da73009a28bfeec5f6e2b225dde191a1f55d3a49cc45ee6973ade96b442cd5a", "ja": "……いや、別に変だとは思わないよ。そうだな……\n俺は、桃子に新しい衣装を着てもらえて、嬉しいぞ！", "zh": "……不，这样并不奇怪。我想想……\n像我看到桃子穿新服装就很开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "6fbb677316c7092073741c57ae71654622e4c36f8dcfec0de04cb9f8fd31a649", "ja": "え……？　お兄ちゃん、うれしいの？\n桃子が、新しい衣装着るの……。", "zh": "咦……？大哥哥，你觉得很开心吗？\n看到桃子穿新服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1c220a653aa81b0bd042d8ec250e61f8d48f3e4223ab03b5db4487d690a75779", "ja": "もちろん！　担当してるアイドルが可愛くなって、\n嬉しくないプロデューサーなんていないよ。", "zh": "当然！看到担当的偶像变得更可爱，\n有哪个制作人不会开心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1d3e41ae5b311020140e3def655f3feae8a95dce7771ef4e2ed8b9848755263c", "ja": "だから桃子が怖かったり、心配だったりしても、\nその分まで俺が嬉しがるから、安心してくれ。", "zh": "所以桃子，当你感到担心害怕的时候，\n就让我来为你高兴吧，放心好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "4e9bebda848655c9d63bb57603d6e69808657873edeeac8526337034b29e17a6", "ja": "な、何それ、意味わかんない……。そ、それに、\n桃子だって、うれしくないわけじゃないんだから……！", "zh": "什、什么意思啊？莫名其妙……而、而且，\n桃子又没有不开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "5a58dc6c0768a95844f281e2e132333fa493a0ce42e04b6b44bfacf1850c04f6", "ja": "だってこれは、お兄ちゃんが桃子のために……\n桃子だけに、用意してくれた衣装なんでしょ？", "zh": "因为这是大哥哥为了桃子准备的……\n专属于桃子的服装，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "d2f9a9eded2b9fba7d0f0eda2b4bf64ccb383cd779e37564d04475a4e0819d3e", "ja": "だからお兄ちゃんなんかより、桃子のほうが、\n100万倍くらいうれしいんだからね！　ふーんだ！", "zh": "所以桃子可是比大哥哥\n还要开心上100万倍！哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b303955de75a0dd3c7652eee1e69e9e69ead0d38940881a77078aa19c240ffd7", "ja": "ははっ、100万倍か。\nそれじゃ、俺なんか敵わないかもしれないな。", "zh": "哈哈，100万倍是吧。\n那我大概是望尘莫及了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "8ce6a37cb2c7a8ff40bd63ca329a2c8c0166aa8f1230e15de3d0876fbb2bafe3", "ja": "そ、そうだよ！\n桃子のほうが、ずっとうれしいんだから……。", "zh": "没、没错！\n桃子比你开心多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "90001e05feeff558b2f18d7f11f28d38abecda274cf93f4acb20aa8325604ed7", "ja": "いい？　お兄ちゃん。覚悟してね。\n桃子を喜ばせたからには、裏切っちゃダメなんだから！", "zh": "听好啰，大哥哥，你要有心理准备。\n现在让桃子这么开心，以后就不准让桃子失望！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0054_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "6e471df4b1ad491408e3a3d62dcaa71df6760d5371d8f125429c2135aad88c15", "ja": "ずっと桃子を喜ばせないと、許さないよ。\n……わかったら、返事！", "zh": "要一直让桃子很开心，不然就不原谅你。\n……听懂了就回答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
